        "created_at": "2013-06-19T08:44:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm. I see Timeshift as O-X messing witht the timestream so that something you did in the past or will do in the future is happening right now. So it would kind of follow that if the particular moment he's skpping to was one where Nightmist <span class=\"bbcode-i\">wasn't</span> Master of Magic, she wouldn't regain HP, even if she's Master of Magic right now.</p>\n<p>Now my brain is confused.</p>",
